    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 12 Beech Road, An Na Gréine, Milltown — a home that instantly feels just right. From the moment you step inside, this beautifully maintained property welcomes you with warmth, comfort and a quality finish throughout. Bright, cosy and exceptionally clean, it truly feels like home. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers a generous eat-in kitchen, perfect for everyday living and entertaining, alongside a spacious sitting room with a feature fireplace. Patio doors flood the space with natural light and open out to the private rear garden, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor flow. A separate utility/laundry room and main floor washroom complete the ground floor layout. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, you’ll find three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, along with a modern family bathroom and hot press providing excellent storage. This bright and fresh home also benefits from off-street parking for two cars and is ideally located within easy reach of shops, cafés, schools and churches, making it perfect for families, first-time buyers or investors alike.  \r\n\r\n***VIEWINGS HAVE BEGUN. Tenant in situ - notice served- vacant possession expected. ***"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Sitting room with solid fuel fireplace\r\nSpacious, lightfilled, open concept main floor\r\nSeperate laundry/ utility room for added convenience\r\nLovely, private, fenced back yard with access on the side from the front\r\nBER= B rated property which is said to qualify for a \"green mortgage\"\r\nOff street parking for 2\r\nQuiet estate with close proximity to shops, cafes, chemist, schools etc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      }
